<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-TASMANIAN WOMEN'S INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TASMANIAN WOMEN'S INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART, Australia 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results</p>
<p>from the Tasmanian Women's International tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Thursday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Marianne Werdel Witmeyer (U.S.) beat 6-Wang Shi-ting (Taiwan)</p>
<p>6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Mana Endo (Japan) beat Annabel Ellwood (Australia) 3-6 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Dominique van Roost beat Lenka Cenkova (Czech Republic) 6-0 1-0</p>
<p>forfeit</p>
<p>Els Callens (Belgium) beat Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) 6-3 3-6</p>
<p>6-0</p>
</text>
